---
to: "chapter-readmes/INDEX.md"
sparql:
  entities: |
    PREFIX gc: <https://ggen.io/ontology/ggen-create#>
    SELECT ?name ?upper ?lower ?capitalized ?pascal ?camel ?snake ?upper_snake ?kebab ?title
    WHERE {
      gc:subject a gc:GenerationSubject ;
          gc:name ?name ;
          gc:upper ?upper ;
          gc:lower ?lower ;
          gc:capitalized ?capitalized ;
          gc:pascal ?pascal ;
          gc:camel ?camel ;
          gc:snake ?snake ;
          gc:upper_snake ?upper_snake ;
          gc:kebab ?kebab ;
          gc:title ?title .
    }
for_each: entities
---
{% raw %}# Per-Chapter README Index

This pack captures the book's 14 chapters as one cumulative, layered project (see the
pack's top-level description). That layering necessarily overwrites same-path files —
including `README.md` — with the latest chapter's version, which discards each earlier
chapter's own "Code-to-Chapter Mapping" table.

This directory restores those 13 discarded chapter READMEs (Ch01 through Ch13; Ch14's is
the project's own top-level `README.md`, unchanged) as plain reference copies, so a reader
can still find the section/listing a given file corresponds to in its original chapter,
even though the merged tree no longer carries that chapter's own README at the project
root.

| Chapter | Topic | Reference README |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Laying the Groundwork | [Ch01-README.md](Ch01-README.md) |
| 2 | Building the Cluster Foundation | [Ch02-README.md](Ch02-README.md) |
| 3 | Identity, Access, and Policy Guardrails | [Ch03-README.md](Ch03-README.md) |
| 4 | Observability from Day One | [Ch04-README.md](Ch04-README.md) |
| 5 | Developer Experience and Golden Paths | [Ch05-README.md](Ch05-README.md) |
| 6 | The Developer Portal (Backstage) | [Ch06-README.md](Ch06-README.md) |
| 7 | Self-Service Onboarding | [Ch07-README.md](Ch07-README.md) |
| 8 | Progressive Delivery Pipelines | [Ch08-README.md](Ch08-README.md) |
| 9 | Self-Service Infrastructure (Crossplane) | [Ch09-README.md](Ch09-README.md) |
| 10 | Starter Kits and Templates | [Ch10-README.md](Ch10-README.md) |
| 11 | Policy as Code and Compliance | [Ch11-README.md](Ch11-README.md) |
| 12 | Cost Optimization (FinOps) | [Ch12-README.md](Ch12-README.md) |
| 13 | Resilience, Backup, and Disaster Recovery | [Ch13-README.md](Ch13-README.md) |
| 14 | AI-Augmented Platform Engineering | project root `README.md` |

Note: `.circleci/config.yml` and `load-secrets.sh` at the project root have the same
same-path-overwrite issue. `.circleci/config.yml` only exists in Ch01 and Ch02 — the
project root's version is **Ch02's**, not Ch14's. `load-secrets.sh` exists in Ch03, 06, 07,
08, 09, 10, and 14 — the project root's version is Ch14's. Neither collision has a
restored-variants directory (only README.md's did, being by far the most information-dense
of the three); see the individual chapter READMEs above for what each chapter's own version
looked like.
{% endraw %}